# esp-idf component entry: esp-idf automatically collects every component's
# Kconfig.projbuild into the root menu, so the "tuyaopen-core" menu appears in
# idf.py menuconfig and settings are written to sdkconfig.
# esp-idf makes CONFIG_* visible as CMake variables (in component scope); core's
# TuyaOpenOptions.cmake accepts y/1 and normalizes them, closing the loop.
menu "tuyaopen-core"

rsource "Kconfig"

endmenu
